#==============================================================================================
#
#   replaced_with_children_formatting_context - Layout::ReplacedWithChildrenFormattingContext:
#                                               a replaced box whose shadow tree is laid out
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/ReplacedWithChildrenFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1-76): the root
#       box keeps the size its parent formatting context gave it, and the anonymous block
#       container the TreeBuilder wraps its shadow DOM children in is laid out by a
#       BlockFormattingContext.
